    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d31-a7">

                <pb facs="0157" n="65" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg65"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 7.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thoman to Mr. Herdliska.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-09-16"><hi rendition="#italic">September 16,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    esteemed favor of the 10th instant (which reached me yesterday), and to express
                    my sincere thanks for the interest which you are giving my case. Hoping that
                    your efforts will meet with success and that I may soon be in possession of a
                    favorable reply, I beg, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moris Thoman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
